SUMMARY:World Cup Round of 32 : México vs TBD
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWhile I mainly root for the the US t
 eam\, I have to give Mexican fans credit for being some of the most passio
 nate supporters in the world. My ears are still ringing from watching thei
 r match against Czechia. If you want to experience the incredible energy o
 f El Tri and their fans\, come join us at Barbaro's watch party for Méxic
 o's round of 32 World Cup match.\n\nBarbaro is located right behind Mezcal
 ito in Durham. They have a really nice outdoor viewing area\, and also ser
 ve some great drinks & food. The match starts at 9 but I'll be there aroun
 d 8 to grab a spot.\n\n\\*You may want to bring ear plugs if you have sens
 itive hearing\, it will get loud when México scores.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31541
 2344/
