DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260701T220000
SUMMARY:World Cup Round of 32 : USA vs TBD
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nThe World Cup groups stages are over
 \, so now it's time for the real tournament to start\, aka the "Knockout R
 ounds". Come join us at Bull McCabe's for the USMNT's round of 32 match. T
 he US was one of the first teams to qualify for the knockout rounds\, so w
 e won't know our opponent until the rest of the group stage matches playou
 t.\n\nWe'll be headed back to Bull McCabe's for this contest. In my opinio
 n\, it's the best place to watch a footie game in the Triangle \,and I wou
 ldn't want to be anywhere else for a match this big. Kick off is at 8pm\, 
 but I'll be there around 6:30 to grab a spot.\n\n**\\*\\*Look for parking 
 on or around Main St. There's also the Corcoran St. parking garage which i
 s free after 7 on weeknights. Bull McCabe's will be busy for this game so 
 I would highly recommend you arrive at least an hour before kickoff.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31536
 8511/
